"speaker":"neve","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_19","text":"I know that I can't, at least not now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"neve","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_20","text":"First things first: we need to find those Nikkes, and then you and I can cozy up in our den and hibernate.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"neve","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_21","text":"Until then, you and I will just have to wait, hehe.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_22","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_22","text":"*Crunch crunch*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_23","type":"Monologue","speaker":"Monologue","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_23","text":"Neve strides forward with palpable frivolity.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_24","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_25","text":"You all seem so relaxed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_26","text":"Of course, it's not like I'm nervous or anything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_27","text":"I mean, sure, this is my first mission,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_28","text":"and we may end up being too late with our rescue efforts...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_29","text":"Don't worry. It's understandable to have such reservations.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_30","text":"There's not one among us who hasn't gone through the same self-doubt.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_31","text":"But you've said it yourself countless times before.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_32","text":"In extreme situations, strong mental fortitude is what will help you survive.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_33","text":"We don't want to drag our feet, and it's good to show initiative,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_34","text":"but these rescue missions can last anywhere from a few days to an entire month.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_35","text":"If we spent that entire time being high-strung,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_36","text":"it might cloud our judgment when we need it the most, which would jeopardize the mission.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_37","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_38","text":"Pssh, don't be ridiculous.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_39","text":"I haven't had a negative thought cross my mind once this entire time.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_40","text":"Glad to hear it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_41","text":"If that's the case, keep it up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_42","type":"Monologue","speaker":"Monologue","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_42","text":"Ludmilla proceeds along the path, moving ahead of Neve and Alice.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_43","text":"You know it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_alonesurvivor_02_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_alonesurvivor_02_s_44","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"af